  <h2 id="pay-ceiling">The real pay ceiling: is there genuine headroom, or is this role capped</h2>

  <p>
    "Hotel management salary in India" is close to a meaningless single number, because the spread between a
    first-year trainee and a luxury-chain general manager is enormous, and most institute marketing quotes only the
    flattering end of it.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
      <thead>
